        <a href="/comparador" style="color:#7025a8; font-weight:750; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7025A8" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg> Comparador de Alimentos</a>
